      "children": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "KeJbJz",
          "name": "Bitrate for Artists",
          "content": "Bitrate for Artists",
          "fontSize": 40,
          "fill": "$--artist-foreground",
          "fontFamily": "$--font-heading",
          "fontWeight": "600",
          "letterSpacing": -0.6
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "zEPRBb",
          "name": "The artist workspace’s own d",
          "content": "The artist workspace’s own design system, drawn after the shipped apps/web-artists living workspace: a diagonal canvas with three brand washes, translucent glass panels, a glass sidebar and header, the gradient purple action. Colours and glass opacity are the code’s tokens (artist-workspace.css and the shared roles) in three themes — Dark, Light, Dim. Artist workspace screens import this file as `artist` and use only its components. Source: scripts/pencil-pages/artist-lib.mjs.",
          "fontSize": 14,
          "fill": "$--artist-text-secondary",
          "width": 900,
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "lineHeight": 1.5,
          "fontFamily": "$--font-sans"
        },
        {
          "type": "frame",
          "id": "UPmZw0",
          "name": "Foundations",
          "layout": "vertical",
          "gap": 24,
          "width": "fill_container",
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "0k0c2v",
              "name": "Foundations",
